{"task_id": "Mbpp/856", "original_task_id": 856, "entry_point": "find_Min_Swaps", "prompt": "Write a python function to find minimum adjacent swaps required to sort binary array.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef find_Min_Swaps(arr, n):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to find minimum adjacent swaps required to sort binary array.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def find_Min_Swaps(arr,n) : \r\n    noOfZeroes = [0] * n \r\n    count = 0 \r\n    noOfZeroes[n - 1] = 1 - arr[n - 1] \r\n    for i in range(n-2,-1,-1) : \r\n        noOfZeroes[i] = noOfZeroes[i + 1] \r\n        if (arr[i] == 0) : \r\n            noOfZeroes[i] = noOfZeroes[i] + 1\r\n    for i in range(0,n) : \r\n        if (arr[i] == 1) : \r\n            count = count + noOfZeroes[i] \r\n    return count ", "tests": "assert find_Min_Swaps([1,0,1,0],4) == 3\nassert find_Min_Swaps([0,1,0],3) == 1\nassert find_Min_Swaps([0,0,1,1,0],5) == 2", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
