{"task_id": "Mbpp/616", "original_task_id": 616, "entry_point": "tuple_modulo", "prompt": "Write a function to perfom the modulo of tuple elements in the given two tuples.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef tuple_modulo(test_tup1, test_tup2):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function to perfom the modulo of tuple elements in the given two tuples.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def tuple_modulo(test_tup1, test_tup2):\r\n  res = tuple(ele1 % ele2 for ele1, ele2 in zip(test_tup1, test_tup2)) \r\n  return (res) ", "tests": "assert tuple_modulo((10, 4, 5, 6), (5, 6, 7, 5)) == (0, 4, 5, 1)\nassert tuple_modulo((11, 5, 6, 7), (6, 7, 8, 6)) == (5, 5, 6, 1)\nassert tuple_modulo((12, 6, 7, 8), (7, 8, 9, 7)) == (5, 6, 7, 1)", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/663", "original_task_id": 663, "entry_point": "find_max_val", "prompt": "Write a function to find the largest possible value of k such that k modulo x is y.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef find_max_val(n, x, y):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function to find the largest possible value of k such that k modulo x is y.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "import sys \r\ndef find_max_val(n, x, y): \r\n\tans = -sys.maxsize \r\n\tfor k in range(n + 1): \r\n\t\tif (k % x == y): \r\n\t\t\tans = max(ans, k) \r\n\treturn (ans if (ans >= 0 and\r\n\t\t\t\t\tans <= n) else -1) ", "tests": "assert find_max_val(15, 10, 5) == 15\nassert find_max_val(187, 10, 5) == 185\nassert find_max_val(16, 11, 1) == 12", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
