{"task_id": "Mbpp/763", "original_task_id": 763, "entry_point": "find_Min_Diff", "prompt": "Write a python function to find the minimum difference between any two elements in a given array.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef find_Min_Diff(arr, n):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to find the minimum difference between any two elements in a given array.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def find_Min_Diff(arr,n): \r\n    arr = sorted(arr) \r\n    diff = 10**20 \r\n    for i in range(n-1): \r\n        if arr[i+1] - arr[i] < diff: \r\n            diff = arr[i+1] - arr[i]  \r\n    return diff ", "tests": "assert find_Min_Diff((1,5,3,19,18,25),6) == 1\nassert find_Min_Diff((4,3,2,6),4) == 1\nassert find_Min_Diff((30,5,20,9),4) == 4", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
