{"task_id": "Mbpp/918", "original_task_id": 918, "entry_point": "coin_change", "prompt": "Write a function to count coin change.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef coin_change(S, m, n):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function to count coin change.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def coin_change(S, m, n): \r\n    table = [[0 for x in range(m)] for x in range(n+1)] \r\n    for i in range(m): \r\n        table[0][i] = 1\r\n    for i in range(1, n+1): \r\n        for j in range(m): \r\n            x = table[i - S[j]][j] if i-S[j] >= 0 else 0\r\n            y = table[i][j-1] if j >= 1 else 0 \r\n            table[i][j] = x + y   \r\n    return table[n][m-1] ", "tests": "assert coin_change([1, 2, 3],3,4)==4\nassert coin_change([4,5,6,7,8,9],6,9)==2\nassert coin_change([4,5,6,7,8,9],6,4)==1", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/767", "original_task_id": 767, "entry_point": "get_Pairs_Count", "prompt": "Write a python function to count the number of pairs whose sum is equal to ‘sum’.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef get_Pairs_Count(arr, n, sum):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to count the number of pairs whose sum is equal to ‘sum’.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def get_Pairs_Count(arr,n,sum):\r\n    count = 0  \r\n    for i in range(0,n):\r\n        for j in range(i + 1,n):\r\n            if arr[i] + arr[j] == sum:\r\n                count += 1\r\n    return count", "tests": "assert get_Pairs_Count([1,1,1,1],4,2) == 6\nassert get_Pairs_Count([1,5,7,-1,5],5,6) == 3\nassert get_Pairs_Count([1,-2,3],3,1) == 1", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
