{"task_id": "Mbpp/844", "original_task_id": 844, "entry_point": "get_Number", "prompt": "Write a python function to find the kth element in an array containing odd elements first and then even elements.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef get_Number(n, k):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to find the kth element in an array containing odd elements first and then even elements.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def get_Number(n, k): \r\n    arr = [0] * n; \r\n    i = 0; \r\n    odd = 1; \r\n    while (odd <= n):   \r\n        arr[i] = odd; \r\n        i += 1; \r\n        odd += 2;\r\n    even = 2; \r\n    while (even <= n): \r\n        arr[i] = even; \r\n        i += 1;\r\n        even += 2; \r\n    return arr[k - 1]; ", "tests": "assert get_Number(8,5) == 2\nassert get_Number(7,2) == 3\nassert get_Number(5,2) == 3", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
