{"task_id": "Mbpp/648", "original_task_id": 648, "entry_point": "exchange_elements", "prompt": "Write a function to exchange the position of every n-th value with (n+1)th value and (n+1)th value with n-th value in a given list.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef exchange_elements(lst):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a function to exchange the position of every n-th value with (n+1)th value and (n+1)th value with n-th value in a given list.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "from itertools import zip_longest, chain, tee\r\ndef exchange_elements(lst):\r\n    lst1, lst2 = tee(iter(lst), 2)\r\n    return list(chain.from_iterable(zip_longest(lst[1::2], lst[::2])))", "tests": "assert exchange_elements([0,1,2,3,4,5])==[1, 0, 3, 2, 5, 4] \nassert exchange_elements([5,6,7,8,9,10])==[6,5,8,7,10,9] \nassert exchange_elements([25,35,45,55,75,95])==[35,25,55,45,95,75] ", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
