{"task_id": "Mbpp/685", "original_task_id": 685, "entry_point": "sum_Of_Primes", "prompt": "Write a python function to find sum of prime numbers between 1 to n.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef sum_Of_Primes(n):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to find sum of prime numbers between 1 to n.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def sum_Of_Primes(n): \r\n    prime = [True] * (n + 1)  \r\n    p = 2\r\n    while p * p <= n: \r\n        if prime[p] == True:  \r\n            i = p * 2\r\n            while i <= n: \r\n                prime[i] = False\r\n                i += p \r\n        p += 1    \r\n    sum = 0\r\n    for i in range (2,n + 1): \r\n        if(prime[i]): \r\n            sum += i \r\n    return sum", "tests": "assert sum_Of_Primes(10) == 17\nassert sum_Of_Primes(20) == 77\nassert sum_Of_Primes(5) == 10", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
