{"task_id": "Mbpp/625", "original_task_id": 625, "entry_point": "swap_List", "prompt": "Write a python function to interchange first and last elements in a given list.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef swap_List(newList):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to interchange first and last elements in a given list.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def swap_List(newList): \r\n    size = len(newList) \r\n    temp = newList[0] \r\n    newList[0] = newList[size - 1] \r\n    newList[size - 1] = temp   \r\n    return newList ", "tests": "assert swap_List([1,2,3]) == [3,2,1]\nassert swap_List([1,2,3,4,4]) == [4,2,3,4,1]\nassert swap_List([4,5,6]) == [6,5,4]", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
