{"task_id": "Mbpp/777", "original_task_id": 777, "entry_point": "find_Sum", "prompt": "Write a python function to find the sum of non-repeated elements in a given array.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef find_Sum(arr, n):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to find the sum of non-repeated elements in a given array.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def find_Sum(arr,n): \r\n    arr.sort() \r\n    sum = arr[0] \r\n    for i in range(0,n-1): \r\n        if (arr[i] != arr[i+1]): \r\n            sum = sum + arr[i+1]   \r\n    return sum", "tests": "assert find_Sum([1,2,3,1,1,4,5,6],8) == 21\nassert find_Sum([1,10,9,4,2,10,10,45,4],9) == 71\nassert find_Sum([12,10,9,45,2,10,10,45,10],9) == 78", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/962", "original_task_id": 962, "entry_point": "sum_Even", "prompt": "Write a python function to find the sum of all even natural numbers within the range l and r.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef sum_Even(l, r):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to find the sum of all even natural numbers within the range l and r.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def sum_Natural(n): \r\n    sum = (n * (n + 1)) \r\n    return int(sum) \r\ndef sum_Even(l,r): \r\n    return (sum_Natural(int(r / 2)) - sum_Natural(int((l - 1) / 2))) ", "tests": "assert sum_Even(2,5) == 6\nassert sum_Even(3,8) == 18\nassert sum_Even(4,6) == 10", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/683", "original_task_id": 683, "entry_point": "sum_Square", "prompt": "Write a python function to check whether the given number can be represented by sum of two squares or not.\n\nImplement this Python function. Return only the complete implementation.\ndef sum_Square(n):\n    pass", "original_prompt": "Write a python function to check whether the given number can be represented by sum of two squares or not.", "prompt_protocol": "mbpp-function-interface-v1", "interface_source": "reference-ast-signature-only", "reference": "def sum_Square(n) : \r\n    i = 1 \r\n    while i*i <= n : \r\n        j = 1\r\n        while (j*j <= n) : \r\n            if (i*i+j*j == n) : \r\n                return True\r\n            j = j+1\r\n        i = i+1     \r\n    return False", "tests": "assert sum_Square(25) == True\nassert sum_Square(24) == False\nassert sum_Square(17) == True", "source": "google-research-datasets/mbpp", "split": "train", "original_split": "train", "dataset_config": "full", "revision": "4bb6404fdc6cacfda99d4ac4205087b89d32030c", "split_seed": 42, "dataset_fingerprint": null}
